---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Marker">
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: March 13, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-muted-foreground [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-foreground [&_h3]:text-lg [&_h3]:font-medium [&_h3]:text-foreground [&_p]:mt-3 [&_ul]:mt-2 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_li]:mt-1">

        <section>
          <h2>Who We Are</h2>
          <p>Marker is a product of Widari Inc., a Delaware corporation. This policy describes how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit onmarker.com ("the Site").</p>
          <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:privacy@onmarker.com" class="text-primary underline">privacy@onmarker.com</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
          <p>When you click "Request a Demo," your email client opens with a pre-filled email to us. We receive whatever information you choose to include in that email (typically your name and email address). We do not collect this information through the Site itself.</p>

          <h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
          <p>The Site uses Google Fonts, which may collect your IP address and browser information when loading fonts. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-primary underline" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
          <p>Our hosting provider (Firebase/Google Cloud) may collect standard server logs including IP addresses, browser type, and pages visited. These logs are used solely for security and performance monitoring.</p>

          <h3>Cookies and Tracking</h3>
          <p>The Site does not currently set any cookies or use any analytics or tracking tools. If this changes, we will update this policy and, where required by law, obtain your consent.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>To respond to demo requests and communicate with you</li>
            <li>To maintain and improve the Site</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How We Share Your Information</h2>
          <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Service providers who help us operate the Site (e.g., Firebase for hosting)</li>
            <li>Law enforcement or regulators when required by law</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 id="california-rights">Your Rights Under California Law (CCPA/CPRA)</h2>
          <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Know what personal information we collect and how it is used</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
            <li>Opt out of the sale or sharing of your personal information (we do not sell or share personal information)</li>
            <li>Not be discriminated against for exercising your privacy rights</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@onmarker.com" class="text-primary underline">privacy@onmarker.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Your Rights Under GDPR (European Economic Area)</h2>
          <p>If you are located in the EEA, UK, or Switzerland, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Rectify inaccurate personal data</li>
            <li>Request erasure of your personal data</li>
            <li>Restrict or object to processing of your personal data</li>
            <li>Data portability</li>
            <li>Lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Our legal basis for processing is legitimate interest (operating and improving the Site) and, where applicable, your consent.</p>
          <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@onmarker.com" class="text-primary underline">privacy@onmarker.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain email correspondence for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected. Server logs are retained per our hosting provider's standard retention policies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Security</h2>
          <p>We use industry-standard security measures including Content Security Policy headers, HTTPS encryption, and access controls to protect information transmitted through the Site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>The Site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the updated policy on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us at:</p>
          <p>Widari Inc.<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@onmarker.com" class="text-primary underline">privacy@onmarker.com</a></p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
